    "sources": [
      {
        "source_id": "source-1",
        "source_ref": "examples/sue-2316/source/lesson-facts.md",
        "kind": "markdown",
        "sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
        "evidence_spans": [
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-01",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-01` 훅: “관중 수가 같은데 순위는 다르다고?” A는 82,800명, B는 83,200명이다. 여기서 같다는 것은 천의 자리까지 **반올림한 관중 수**다. (F1, F2, F3, F8)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2300,
            "byte_end": 2504,
            "span_sha256": "8abea3df3fa362ccd04487e66d09385920edba53f581acd2fccef2db124089c3",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/span/evidence-beat-01/8abea3df3fa362ccd04487e66d09385920edba53f581acd2fccef2db124089c3"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-02",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-02` 규칙: 천의 자리까지 반올림하려면 백의 자리를 보고 0~4는 버리고 5~9는 올린다. (F1, F2, F3)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2505,
            "byte_end": 2635,
            "span_sha256": "0d998632369e7df11106997da9a51f5c71da4d60a622ffbc0d2ed94c04da4b20",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/span/evidence-beat-02/0d998632369e7df11106997da9a51f5c71da4d60a622ffbc0d2ed94c04da4b20"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-03",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-03` 결과: A와 B는 모두 83,000명으로 반올림된다. (F1, F2, F3)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2636,
            "byte_end": 2718,
            "span_sha256": "6263087921edc13aed68393e44be0084602c38b416ce7764d46a11ab32d986eb",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/span/evidence-beat-03/6263087921edc13aed68393e44be0084602c38b416ce7764d46a11ab32d986eb"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-04",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-04` 실제 차이: B − A = 400명이다. (F1, F2, F4, F8)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2719,
            "byte_end": 2786,
            "span_sha256": "0c87bb53a2bd0fd1f018e6f5f02f22455911f189c7e1ade2e0f906c949edd141",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/span/evidence-beat-04/0c87bb53a2bd0fd1f018e6f5f02f22455911f189c7e1ade2e0f906c949edd141"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-05",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-05` 수직선: 82,500 / 83,000 / 83,500을 표시한다. 83,000으로 반올림되는 정수 범위는 82,500..83,499이다. (F5, F6, F7)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2787,
            "byte_end": 2932,
            "span_sha256": "d7b690fb372773ca83fa64dcfe46f7987f75aa7cd074b22e466192e66304c142",
            "evidence_ref": "source-extraction://sha256/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48/span/evidence-beat-05/d7b690fb372773ca83fa64dcfe46f7987f75aa7cd074b22e466192e66304c142"
          },
          {
            "span_id": "evidence-beat-06",
            "exact_text": "- `beat-06` 마무리 질문: “그럼 83,499는? 83,500은?” 답: 각각 83,000, 84,000이다. (F5, F7)",
            "source_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "extraction_sha256": "c02e2ebd0a7cddce3bdf1b25e834a87bdb2fb4494b15888eea6b440a8351bc48",
            "byte_start": 2933,
            "byte_end": 3040,
